{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656480",
      "title": "TD: Using ngModel with Two-Way-Binding",
      "lectureOrder": 520,
      "videoOrder": 476,
      "sourceHash": "61479ccca967f4a6cf218e69a23bf5428948fb7cc863a1357806f5b5c8f0c596",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.64,
          "end": 5.28,
          "en": "-: Sometimes, you not only want to pre-populate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.28,
          "end": 8.19,
          "en": "the default user entered, but you also want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.19,
          "end": 11.49,
          "en": "to instantly react to any changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.49,
          "end": 15.21,
          "en": "Right now, everything about this form here only updates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.21,
          "end": 18.57,
          "en": "once I click \"Submit,\" then I get this form object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.57,
          "end": 20.16,
          "en": "where I can retrieve the value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.16,
          "end": 21.87,
          "en": "We don't use two-way binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.87,
          "end": 24.72,
          "en": "ngModel is either used without any binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.72,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "or with one-way binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 29.55,
          "en": "But sometimes you instantly want to check something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.55,
          "end": 33.42,
          "en": "or simply repeat whatever the user entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.42,
          "end": 35.4,
          "en": "Let's show an example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.4,
          "end": 37.29,
          "en": "For this question here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.29,
          "end": 39.3,
          "en": "I'm going to add a new \"form-group,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.3,
          "end": 43.41,
          "en": "bootstrap style here, below the dropdown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.41,
          "end": 45.42,
          "en": "I want to have a \"textarea\" let's say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.42,
          "end": 48.27,
          "en": "to also introduce a new input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.27,
          "end": 51.087,
          "en": "Let's name it \"questionAnswer.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.42,
          "end": 57.24,
          "en": "Don't need the \"id\" here, don't need columns,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.24,
          "end": 59.85,
          "en": "I want to have 3 rows, let's say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.85,
          "end": 62.7,
          "en": "and I'll also distribute this over model lines,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.7,
          "end": 65.7,
          "en": "and now we could add \"ngModel\" to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.7,
          "end": 68.97,
          "en": "to whatever the user entered as a reply.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.97,
          "end": 72.15,
          "en": "But maybe, for some reason we instantly want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.15,
          "end": 74.67,
          "en": "to repeat this reply.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.67,
          "end": 78.69,
          "en": "So below this we could say \"Your reply:\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.69,
          "end": 82.473,
          "en": "and now we want to output the answer to the question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.37,
          "end": 87,
          "en": "Well, for this, we could still use two-way binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87,
          "end": 92,
          "en": "on ngModel here, and bind it to the answer property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.25,
          "end": 94.62,
          "en": "Of course, we need to introduce this answer property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.62,
          "end": 98.75999999999999,
          "en": "then there, an answer could be an empty string by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.75999999999999,
          "end": 103.22999999999999,
          "en": "With this in place, let me also add a CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.22999999999999,
          "end": 105.12,
          "en": "to the text area \"form-control,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.12,
          "end": 107.4,
          "en": "to give it some nice styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.4,
          "end": 111.75,
          "en": "If this reloads, we see our text area here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.75,
          "end": 113.75999999999999,
          "en": "and if I enter valid data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.75999999999999,
          "end": 118.47,
          "en": "for my first pet let's say, a rabbit named Nelly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.47,
          "end": 120.12,
          "en": "you instantly see that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.12,
          "end": 122.88,
          "en": "So you can still use two-way binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.88,
          "end": 126.39,
          "en": "And actually, if I submit the whole form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.39,
          "end": 131.39,
          "en": "and open up the developer tools, you see in the value object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.73,
          "end": 134.85,
          "en": "this is still part of this value object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.85,
          "end": 137.67000000000002,
          "en": "it just is updated with every key stroke,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.67000000000002,
          "end": 141.12,
          "en": "but of course if we submit it, we will get a snapshot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.12,
          "end": 144,
          "en": "of the value at a point of time we hit \"Submit.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144,
          "end": 146.7,
          "en": "So two-way binding is still possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.7,
          "end": 150,
          "en": "You can still use ngModel with two-way binding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150,
          "end": 152.67000000000002,
          "en": "and with that, you saw all 3 forms,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.67000000000002,
          "end": 157.2,
          "en": "no binding to just tell Angular data input is a control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.2,
          "end": 160.82999999999998,
          "en": "one-way binding to give that control a default value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.82999999999998,
          "end": 163.44,
          "en": "and two-way binding to instantly output it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.44,
          "end": 166.413,
          "en": "or do whatever you want to do with that value.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
